---
layout: layouts/base.vto
bodyClass: page-article
title: Datenschutz
description: Datenschutzerklärung der Idea Keep.
url: /datenschutz/
markdownUrl: /datenschutz.md
---
<article class="article legal-page" lang="de">
  <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to the Keep</a>

  <header class="article-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Datenschutz&shy;erklärung</h1>
    <p class="article-summary" lang="en">
      {{ if cloudflareAnalyticsToken }}The Keep sets no cookies and tracks nothing without your consent.{{ else }}The Keep sets no cookies and tracks nothing.{{ /if }}
    </p>
    <a class="markdown-link" href="{{ markdownUrl }}" lang="en">Read as Markdown</a>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    {{ set body }}{{ include "datenschutz_body.vto" { impressumUrl: "/impressum/", standDatum: legal.privacyUpdated } }}{{ /set }}
    {{ body |> md |> safe }}

    <p><a href="/impressum/">Zum Impressum</a></p>
  </div>
</article>
